        "_id": "64121a427e4909dcafd40f6a",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.2.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c980",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.2",
        "content": "Nakkira ddala ku ntobo wansi w’amayengo, okufa ne kumbeerera ddala kumpi;\n    Amazzi nga ganneetoolodde\n    era ng’omuddo gw’omu nnyanja gunneezingiridde ku mutwe.",
        "reference": "Yona 2:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a427e4909dcafd40fa7",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.2.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c980",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.2",
        "content": "Ne ŋŋendera ddala ku ntobo, ensozi z’omu nnyanja gye zisibuka, eyo,\n    ensi n’ensibirayo emirembe n’emirembe.\n  Naye ggwe Mukama Katonda wange, onzigye mu bunnya,\n    Ayi Mukama Katonda wange.",
        "reference": "Yona 2:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a437e4909dcafd40fec",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.2.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c980",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.2",
        "content": "“Bwe nnali nga mpweddemu essuubi, emmeeme yange ng’ezirika\n    ne nkujjukira, Ayi Mukama Katonda.\n  Awo okusaba kwange entakeera ne kutuuka\n    mu yeekaalu yo entukuvu.",
        "reference": "Yona 2:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a437e4909dcafd4103f",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.2.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c980",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.2",
        "content": "“Abo abassaayo omwoyo ku balubaale ne bakatonda abataliimu ne babasinza,\n    beefiiriza okusaasirwa kwa Katonda okubalindiridde!",
        "reference": "Yona 2:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a437e4909dcafd41055",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.2.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c980",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.2",
        "content": "Naye nze, n’oluyimba olw’okukutendereza,\n    ndikuwa ssaddaaka.\n  Ddala ndituukiriza obweyamo bwange\n    kubanga obulokozi buva eri Mukama Katonda.”",
        "reference": "Yona 2:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a437e4909dcafd4109a",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.2.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c980",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.2",
        "content": "Awo Mukama Katonda n’alagira ekyennyanja ne kiwandula Yona n’agwa ettale ku lukalu.",
        "reference": "Yona 2:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.2.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a437e4909dcafd41267",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.3.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c9c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.3",
        "content": "Awo ekigambo kya Mukama ne kijjira Yona omulundi ogwokubiri, n’amugamba nti,",
        "reference": "Yona 3:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a437e4909dcafd412e1",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.3.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c9c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.3",
        "content": "“Genda mu kibuga ekinene Nineeve obalabule n’obubaka buno bwe nkuwa.”",
        "reference": "Yona 3:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a437e4909dcafd41307",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.3.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c9c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.3",
        "content": "Awo Yona n’agondera Mukama n’agenda e Nineeve. Nineeve kyali kibuga kya kitiibwa nnyo era nga kitwala ennaku ssatu okukibuna kyonna.",
        "reference": "Yona 3:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a437e4909dcafd41346",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.3.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c9c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.3",
        "content": "Ku lunaku olwasooka Yona yatambula olunaku lwonna ng’agenda alangirira nti, “Bwe waliyitawo ennaku amakumi ana, Nineeve kirizikirira.”",
        "reference": "Yona 3:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a437e4909dcafd41381",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.3.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c9c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.3",
        "content": "Abantu b’omu Nineeve ne bakkiriza Katonda, ne balangirira okusiiba ne beesiba ebibukutu, bonna okuva ku asinga ekitiibwa okutuuka ku asembayo okuba owa wansi.",
        "reference": "Yona 3:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a437e4909dcafd413b1",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.3.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c9c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.3",
        "content": "Amawulire gano bwe gaatuuka ku kabaka w’e Nineeve, n’ayimuka ku ntebe ye ey’obwakabaka, ne yeeyambulamu ekyambalo kye, ne yeesiba ekibukutu, n’atuula mu nfuufu.",
        "reference": "Yona 3:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a447e4909dcafd413ef",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.3.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c9c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.3",
        "content": "Kabaka teyakoma awo, wabula n’ayisa n’etteeka n’alibunya Nineeve yonna nga ligamba nti,\n    Olw’ekiragiro kya kabaka n’abakungu be:\n    “Tewaba muntu yenna, wadde ensolo oba eggana n’ekisibo, okukomba ku mmere wadde amazzi;",
        "reference": "Yona 3:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a447e4909dcafd41445",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.3.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c9c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.3",
        "content": "naye buli muntu n’ekisibo bibikkibwe n’ebibukutu, era bikaabirire nnyo Katonda, era birekeraawo okwonoona n’okukola eby’obukambwe.",
        "reference": "Yona 3:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a447e4909dcafd4146d",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.3.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c9c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.3",
        "content": "Ani amanyi? Oboolyawo Katonda anaakyusa ku kibonerezo kye, kye yatusalira n’akkakkanya obusungu bwe n’atatuzikiriza.”",
        "reference": "Yona 3:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a447e4909dcafd41499",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.3.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c9c6",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.3",
        "content": "Awo Katonda bwe yalaba kye bakoze, ne baleka n’ebibi byabwe, n’abasonyiwa n’atabatuusaako kibonerezo, kye yali agambye okubatuusaako.",
        "reference": "Yona 3:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.3.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a447e4909dcafd4166a",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.4.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3c9f1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.4",
            "number": "4",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.4",
        "content": "Naye Yona n’anyiiga nnyo.",
        "reference": "Yona 4:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 4,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.4.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a447e4909dcafd41717",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.4.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3c9f1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.4",
            "number": "4",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.4",
        "content": "N’alyoka yeemulugunyiza Katonda n’amugamba nti, “Kino ddala kye nalowooza, Mukama, bwe nnali mu nsi ye waffe, lwe wasooka okuŋŋamba okujja eno. Kye kyanzirusa n’okunzirusa okugenda e Talusiisi; kubanga namanya nti ggwe oli Katonda ajjudde obulungi, alwawo okusunguwala, alina ekisa ekingi, era namanya nti ojja kwanguwa okukyusa entegeka zo ez’okuzikiriza abantu bano.",
        "reference": "Yona 4:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 4,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.4.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a447e4909dcafd41751",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.4.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3c9f1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.4",
            "number": "4",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.4",
        "content": "Kale nno nkwegayiridde Mukama nzita; okufa kisinga okuba omulamu.”",
        "reference": "Yona 4:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 4,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.4.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a447e4909dcafd41789",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.4.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3c9f1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.4",
            "number": "4",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.4",
        "content": "Awo Mukama n’agamba nti, “Olina ekituufu kw’osinziira okunyiiga?”",
        "reference": "Yona 4:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 4,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.4.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a447e4909dcafd417d9",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.4.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3c9f1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.4",
            "number": "4",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "62659940c35ce9345a7365de",
            "book": "62661e1fc35ce9345aa3c8d7"
        },
        "chapterId": "JON.4",
        "content": "Awo Yona n’afuluma ebweru w’ekibuga n’abeera ku luuyi lwakyo olw’ebuvanjuba, era ne yeekolerawo akasiisira mu makoola, n’alinda alabe ekinatuuka ku kibuga.",
        "reference": "Yona 4:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 4,
        "chapterAudioUrl": "https://cdn-cmp-audio.thruthebible.io/14b06ff3b2cf5e97-01/JON/JON.4.mp3"
    },
    {
        "_id": "64121a447e4909dcafd41835",
        "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
        "id": "JON.4.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "JON",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "62661e20c35ce9345aa3c9f1",
            "bibleId": "f276be3571f516cb-01",
            "bookId": "JON",
            "id": "JON.4",
